---
---
<section id="beyond" class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto py-20 px-8">
  <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-navy dark:text-white">Beyond the Lab</h2>
  <hr class="w-12 h-[3px] bg-gold border-none my-4" />
  <p class="max-w-[720px] text-base mb-8">
    I believe engineering character is shaped as much outside the classroom as within it.
    When I'm not teaching or building programs, you'll find me:
  </p>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_320px] gap-10 items-start">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto"><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z"/></svg></div>
        <div class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-navy dark:text-white mb-1">Yoga & Rock Climbing</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-caption leading-relaxed">
          Yoga and climbing in the Front Range. Both reward patience and small adjustments, which is most of engineering.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto"><path d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"/><path d="m15 5 4 4"/></svg></div>
        <div class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-navy dark:text-white mb-1">Charcoal Art</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-caption leading-relaxed">
          Charcoal drawing and sketching, mostly as a practice in looking carefully.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto"><path d="m17 14 3 3.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7 1.7H4.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7-1.7L7 14h-.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7-1.7L9 9h-.2A1 1 0 0 1 8 7.3L12 3l4 4.3a1 1 0 0 1-.8 1.7H15l3 3.3a1 1 0 0 1-.7 1.7H17Z"/><path d="M12 22v-3"/></svg></div>
        <div class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-navy dark:text-white mb-1">Colorado Outdoors</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-caption leading-relaxed">
          Hiking, skiing, and exploring the Front Range. Golden is one of the best places in the country to be an engineer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-gold mb-3" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="mx-auto"><path d="M8 22h8"/><path d="M7 10h10"/><path d="M12 15v7"/><path d="M12 15a5 5 0 0 0 5-5c0-2-.5-4-2-8H9c-1.5 4-2 6-2 8a5 5 0 0 0 5 5Z"/></svg></div>
        <div class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-navy dark:text-white mb-1">Craft Distilling</div>
        <p class="text-xs text-caption leading-relaxed">
          Co-founder of <a href="https://methodandmusespirits.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-gold no-underline hover:underline">Method & Muse Spirits</a> (<a href="/projects/method-muse" class="text-gold no-underline hover:underline">project page</a>), an award-winning craft distillery in Golden with a tasting room in downtown Arvada, with fellow Mines faculty and alumni.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="rounded-md overflow-hidden border border-mist dark:border-steel/30">
      <img src="/images/method-muse-exterior.jpg" alt="Method & Muse Spirits tasting room storefront in downtown Arvada, Colorado"
        loading="lazy" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
      <figcaption class="text-xs text-caption p-3 bg-cloud dark:bg-slate/40">Method & Muse tasting room, downtown Arvada</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
